  "name": "Carry a rename",
  "kind": "function",
  "responsibility": "Writes a rename, then carries this server's claim and the lines agents wrote to the board's new name",
  "description": "renameSemanticBoard states the rename as a transition and writes it. When the write moved the board to a new name, the lines agents wrote about the board stay with it and this server's claim follows, for the reason it was taken. A claim that could not follow adds a CLAIM_NOT_CARRIED warning to the answer. The server only points its panes at the new name.",
